 renamed in the live bridge\n    \n    Spec: skilled-barter-overlays/002-spec-tracks-restructure/039-overlays-framework-root-layout\n    Commit-Id: 0000071\n\n .gitignore                                         |   3 +-\n overlays/README.md                                 |   1 +\n68:/overlays/repin-runs/\n69:/overlays/relayout-runs/\n72:overlays/framework/**/node_modules/\n73:overlays/framework/**/dist/","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Skilled/specs/system-skilled-doctor/007-overlay-framework-root-layout/review/lineages/opus-medium/frontier-nodes.jsonl","hunks":[{"oldStart":4,"oldLines":3,"newStart":4,"newLines":4,"lines":[" {\"nodeId\":\"F-1-007\",\"parentId\":\"root\",\"depth\":1,\"scope\":[\"specs/system-skilled-doctor/007-overlay-framework-root-layout\"],\"question\":\"Are the remediation records traceable: do phases 006-review-remediation, 007-barter-review-fixes and 008-push-and-repin (spec, tasks, acceptance criteria, implementation summaries) and the ai-speckit record (e63bd038a5d) match the code and the test runs they cite, are prior R4-P2-001 (005 acceptance-criteria.md:66) and R6-P2-001 (002 spec.md:109) corrected, and is any completion claim, including the push and the blocked merge of main with origin, made without evidence?\",\"status\":\"open\",\"reason\":null,\"iteration\":0,\"dedupeKey\":\"are the remediation records traceable do phases 006 review remediation 007 barter review fixes and 008 push and repin spec tasks acceptance criteria implementation summaries and the ai speckit record e63bd038a5d match the code and the test runs they cite are prior r4 p2 001 005 acceptance criteria md 66 and r6 p2 001 002 spec md 109 corrected and is any completion claim including the push and the blocked merge of main with origin made without evidence\"}"," {\"nodeId\":\"F-1-001\",\"parentId\":\"root\",\"depth\":1,\"scope\":[\".skilled/commands