{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Q8rkd88QY16p9TkezcZ8ws","type":"tool_result","content":"overlays/framework/changelog/skilled-coder/v4.1.0.0.md:153:- An ai-speckit session may commit `specs/skilled-barter-overlays/`.\noverlays/framework/changelog/skilled-coder/v4.1.0.0.md:271:ai-speckit vendors Skilled under `skilled/`. Barter's changes live in `skilled/barter-overlays/`, and the doctor overlay engine carries them \noverlays/framework/changelog/skilled-coder/v4.1.0.0.md:290:- A Barter-owned file changes in `skilled/barter-overlays/` first.\noverlays/framework/changelog/skilled-coder/v4.1.0.0.md:477:- A file that `barter-overlays/` owns changes there first.\noverlays/framework/changelog/skilled-coder/v4.1.0.0.md:614:- Change a Barter file in `skilled/barter-overlays/`, then apply it.\noverlays/framework/changelog/skilled-coder/v4.1.0.0.md:639:> Spec folders: specs/skilled-barter-overlays/001-coder-skilled-v4-conversion, specs/skilled-barter-overlays/002-spec-tracks-restructure, spe\noverlays/framework/skills/sk-code/shared/references/developer-questions.md:111:Where a mode has more than 30 such names, its tables give the count per file and the 20 names to check first, ranked by h\noverlays/framework/skills/sk-git/ROUTER.md:94:    \"Does the command or staged set include a path under specs/ outside specs/skilled-barter-overlays/?\",\noverlays/framework/skills/sk-git/SKILL.md:68:- In an ai-speckit session it refuses writes aimed at another repository and writes involving a path under `specs/`, including a glob, variable, pathspec-m\noverlays/framework/skills/sk-git/SKILL.md:98:| Staged path under `specs/` outside `specs/skilled-barter-overlays/` | Refuse and identify the path. |\n function workspace(t, { pinnedText, liveText }) {\n   const root = fs.mkdtempSync(path.join(os.tmpdir(), 'compiled-routing-byte-parity-'));\n   t.after(() => fs.rmSync(root, { recursive: true, force: true }));\n-  const overlayRoot = path.join(root, '