{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011ChEWjQv5hcSpKb2MKda8J","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01A4dJMVbnM4Gf3t3Ugkt9PD","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Skilled; L=specs/system-skilled-doctor/007-overlay-framework-root-layout/review/lineages/opus-medium; B=barter/ai-speckit; H=$B/overlays/root/opencode/scripts/git-hooks/pre-commit; G=$B/overlays/framework/hooks/barter-overlay-guard/lib/barter-overlay-guard-core.cjs; W=$B/overlays/framework/skills/sk-git/scripts/hooks/barter-git-write-gate.mjs; F=.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/overlay-engine-fixes.test.cjs; R=$B/overlays/README.md; cat > $L/iterations/iteration-003.md <<EOF\n# Iteration 003 - Frontier node F-1-005: correctness\n\n## Dispatcher\n\n- Lineage: opus-medium, session fanout-opus-medium-1795192401900-xpt66n\n- Node: F-1-005 (Barter hygiene, read-only nested repo), dimension correctness\n- Review focus addressed: verified the ai-speckit fix commit 5dd004f3faa (commit gate fails closed without a manifest, hooks read overlayDir, relayout-runs ignore, fixture rename) and swept both repositories for leftover barter-overlays references outside spec history and changelogs.\n- Sources: steer.md absent; strategy; frontier block F-1-005; \\`git log 64cfee51628..e63bd038a5d\\` in barter/ai-speckit.\n\n## Files Reviewed\n\n- \\`$H:83-170\\` (overlay lookup, no-manifest refusal, engine status and pre-commit calls); deployed copy \\`$B/skilled/.opencode/scripts/git-hooks/pre-commit\\` is byte-identical (diff exit 0)\n- \\`$G:53-100\\` (overlaysRootFor, matchLayout, findBarterOverlays)\n- \\`$W:177-200\\` (overlaysRootFor, aiSpeckitRoot)\n- \\`.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/overlay-engine.cjs:72-73\\` and resolveOverlayDir (engine setting reader)\n- \\`$B/.gitignore:68-69\\`, \\`$R:8, 44-48, 234, 458-459\\`, \\`$B/overlays/framework/repo-rules/barter-overlay-first.md:44-63\\`\n- \\`$B/overlays/tests/compiled-routing-byte-parity.test.cjs\\` (fixture diff in 5dd004f3faa)\n- \\`git grep barter-overlays\\` in both repositories, excluding specs/ and changelogs\n\n## Findings by Severity\n\n### P0 Findings\n\nNone.\n\n### P1 Findings\n\nNone.\n\n### P2 Findings\n\n1. **A Skilled engine test still names its overlay folder barter-overlays** -- $F:79 -- The setting test builds its custom overlay folder as \\`barter-overlays\\` and asserts on it at \\`$F:91, 96, 99\\`. It is the last live reference to the retired Barter folder name in the framework repository outside spec history, and the vendored copy carries it into ai-speckit at \\`$B/skilled/.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/overlay-engine-fixes.test.cjs:79\\`. The test only needs a non-default name, so the name is a leftover, not a requirement.\n   - Finding class: naming-leftover\n   - Scope proof: \\`git grep barter-overlays\\` outside specs/, barter/ and changelogs returns only these four lines.\n   - Affected surface hints: overlay-engine-fixes.test.cjs setting test; the vendored copy updates on the next re-pin.\n   - Case: an operator greps for barter-overlays to confirm the rename landed and still finds a hit in the engine tests of both repositories.\n\n2. **overlays/README.md does not document that the commit hook now refuses a vendored commit when no manifest is found** -- $R:47 -- The README's commit-hook paragraph says only that the hook runs status and then pre-commit, and the overlay-first rule (\\`$B/overlays/framework/repo-rules/barter-overlay-first.md:63\\`) describes only the engine's pre-commit check. Since 5dd004f3faa the hook also blocks with exit 1 when vendored paths are staged and the manifest the setting names is missing, and prints a visible skip line when none are (\\`$H:120-146\\`). Neither page names that refusal, the overlayDir lookup it depends on, or its bypass.\n   - Finding class: doc-gap\n   - Scope proof: grep of README.md for \"manifest was found\" or \"skipped\" in the hook paragraph returns nothing; lines 44-48 are the whole paragraph.\n   - Affected surface hints: overlays/README.md commit hook paragraph; barter-overlay-first.md commit gate paragraph.\n   - Case: overlayDir in skilled/.skilled-overlays.json is mistyped; the commit is refused with \"no overlay manifest was found\" and the README gives the operator no account of that refusal.\n\n## Prior-Finding Verification\n\n- R2-P1-001 (commit gate silently skips every check when the folder is not found): FIXED. \\`$H:120-146\\` blocks when a vendored path is staged and prints a skip line otherwise; names are read NUL-separated (\\`$H:124, 132\\`), and the engine calls exit 1 on any non-zero engine exit (\\`$H:156-168\\`).\n- R14-P2-001 (hooks hard-code the overlays folder): FIXED. The guard core (\\`$G:60\\`), the git-write gate (\\`$W:177\\`) and the commit hook (\\`$H:93-107\\`) read overlayDir from .skilled-overlays.json.\n- R3-P2-001 (relayout-runs not ignored): FIXED at \\`$B/.gitignore:69\\`, documented at \\`$R:459\\`.\n- R3-P2-002 (barter-overlays fixture): FIXED in compiled-routing-byte-parity.test.cjs (now \\`overlays\\`).\n\n## Traceability Checks\n\n- spec_code: pass for the ai-speckit commit message claims against the code (fail closed, overlayDir read, ignore, rename).\n\n## Integration Evidence\n\n- Hook lookup and engine reader: the hooks fall back to \\`../overlays\\` (\\`$G:53\\`) when the setting is absent or unparsable, while the engine falls back to \\`skilled-overlays\\` (\\`overlay-engine.cjs:73\\`) when absent and errors when unparsable. For the commit gate the mismatch still fails closed, because the engine call that follows exits non-zero and the hook blocks. Recorded as an edge case, not a finding, because Barter always ships the setting.\n\n## Edge Cases\n\n- Guard core source copy (\\`$G:90\\`) assumes the tree sits beside the overlay folder as \\`skilled/\\`; a non-sibling overlayDir only works through the applied copy. The comment documents this.\n- git-write gate returns \\`path.dirname(tree)\\` as the ai-speckit root regardless of where overlayDir points, which is still the repository root for any legal setting.\n\n## Confirmed-Clean Surfaces\n\n- No-manifest refusal, NUL-separated staged-name loop, engine exit handling, deployed hook parity, .gitignore entries.\n\n## Ruled Out\n\n- Changelog and spec hits for barter-overlays (\\`overlays/framework/changelog/skilled-coder/v4.1.0.0.md\\`, \\`specs/skilled-barter-overlays/\\`): history, out of scope by the node question.\n- \\`skilled-barter-overlays\\` spec-track name in sk-git ROUTER.md and SKILL.md: a track name, not the folder.\n\n## Next Focus\n\n- Dimension: correctness\n- Focus area: frontier node F-1-007 (remediation records traceable to code and test runs)\n- Reason: last unvisited frontier node\n- Rotation status: F-1-001, F-1-003, F-1-005 correctness done\n- Required evidence: phases 006-008 spec, tasks, acceptance criteria, implementation summaries; prior R4-P2-001 and R6-P2-001\n\nReview verdict: PASS\nEOF\ncat > $L/prompts/spec-003.json <<EOF\n{\"iteration\":3,\"node\":\"F-1-005\",\"dimension\":\"correctness\",\"scope\":[\"$H\",\"$G\",\"$W\",\"$R\",\"$B/.gitignore\"],\"priorWeighted\":4,\n\"filesReviewed\":[\"$H:120\",\"$G:53\",\"$W:177\",\"$B/.gitignore:69\",\"$R:47\",\"$F:79\"],\n\"findings\":[{\"id\":\"R3-P2-001\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"title\":\"A Skilled engine test still names its overlay folder barter-overlays\",\"file\":\"$F:79\",\"findingClass\":\"naming-leftover\"},\n{\"id\":\"R3-P2-002\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"title\":\"overlays/README.md does not document that the commit hook refuses a vendored commit when no manifest is found\",\"file\":\"$R:47\",\"findingClass\":\"doc-gap\"}],\n\"traceability\":[{\"protocolId\":\"spec_code\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"gateClass\":\"hard\",\"applicable\":true,\"evidence\":[\"$H:120\",\"$G:60\"],\"summary\":\"5dd004f3faa claims match the hook and guard code\"}],\n\"novelty\":\"Two new P2s (leftover name in Skilled test, README gap); four prior Barter findings verified fixed.\",\n\"ledger\":[{\"bugClass\":\"fail_open_gate\",\"targetRefs\":[\"$H\"],\"hypothesis\":\"commit gate still passes vendored changes without a manifest\",\"result\":\"blocks with exit 1 when vendored paths are staged\",\"evidenceRefs\":[\"$H:134\"],\"disposition\":\"ruled_out\"},\n{\"bugClass\":\"naming_leftover\",\"targetRefs\":[\"$F\"],\"hypothesis\":\"barter-overlays survives outside history\",\"result\":\"engine setting test fixture\",\"evidenceRefs\":[\"$F:79\"],\"disposition\":\"finding\",\"linkedFindingId\":\"R3-P2-001\"},\n{\"bugClass\":\"doc_code_drift\",\"targetRefs\":[\"$R\"],\"hypothesis\":\"README describes the old hook\",\"result\":\"no mention of the no-manifest refusal\",\"evidenceRefs\":[\"$R:47\",\"$H:135\"],\"disposition\":\"finding\",\"linkedFindingId\":\"R3-P2-002\"}],\n\"ruledOut\":[{\"direction\":\"barter-overlays hits in changelogs and specs\",\"reason\":\"history, excluded by the node question\"},{\"direction\":\"hook vs engine fallback mismatch as a fail-open\",\"reason\":\"commit gate still blocks through the engine's non-zero exit\"}]}\nEOF\nnode $L/prompts/emit.cjs $L/prompts/spec-003.json $L 2026-11-20T16:44:00Z 2>&1 | cut -c1-100","description":"Write and record iteration 3"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2126,"cache_read_input_tokens":186953,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2126},"output_tokens":16,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"faa6b93c-ce84-436d-8875-372fa8efb878","uuid":"e924c8de-2aa2-4a8d-90c8-322c8fe3dab0","timestamp":"2026-11-20T16:42:32.584Z","request_id":"req_011ChEWjQfTcrRUGoYZTzhKz","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01A4dJMVbnM4Gf3t3Ugk