sitory block in `AGENTS.md`. The archive does not carry it. |\n | `.dsh/skills/` links to the Barter hubs and modes | Generated by step 5 from the applied skills, never stored here. |\n+| `.vibe/skills/` links and `.vibe/prompts/` stubs for the Barter skills and commands | Written by the apply's `vibe-*` regenerate steps, never stored here. |\n | `skilled/README.md` and `skilled/CONTRIBUTING.md` | Barter's own documents for this vendored copy. A re-pin copies `.skilled` and the runtime folders only, so upstream's root `README.md` is never copied in, and Barter decided not to import it. At each re-pin, read upstream's root `README.md` for changed runtime, command or install facts and carry them into these two files by hand. |\n \n The runtime paths in this table need no overlay entry because no step overwrites\n@@ -284,6 +285,7 @@ The apply runs the manifest's `regenerate` steps, in this order:\n - `sk-doc-derived`: the derived `sk-doc` skill metadata.\n - `mcp-tooling-leaf-manifest`: the `mcp-tooling` leaf manifest.\n - `advisor-command-bridges`: the advisor command bridges, their scorer projection and `skill_advisor.py`.\n+- `vibe-skills`, `vibe-prompts` and `vibe-agents`: the `.vibe/skills/` links, `.vibe/prompts/` stubs and `.vibe/agents/` profiles. Their `--check` runs are in `verifyGenerated`, so `status` fails while a Barter skill or command has no Vibe mirror.\n \n Those files are generated data, so they are never stored here; storing them\n would make this folder the authority for output a generator owns. The `sk-git`","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"faa6b93c-ce84-436d-8875-372fa8efb878","uuid":"6a73263d-6ba8-4ad9-a345-f3aa5b88069c","timestamp":"2026-11-20T16:43:19.298Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"b4799f7d547 docs(specs): close the Barter re-pin onto the pushed Skilled fixes\n3101c9ed363 docs(system-skilled-doctor): record the pushed target commit for the repin\n28aa6f9f83d docs(specs): record the blocked merge of main with orig