to relayout. This is the executable copy of the contradiction R2-P2-001 found in the presentation's reference rows.\n   - Finding class: workflow-doc-contradiction (refines R2-P2-001)\n   - Scope proof: the status YAML has no mention of root/skilled (grep count 0); the apply YAML never suggests relayout for a LAYOUT line.\n   - Affected surface hints: doctor-overlay-status.yaml render rule; doctor-overlay-presentation.txt rows 563 and 595.\n   - Case: status prints \"LAYOUT   hub-notes: source custom/notes.md belongs at root/skilled/notes.md; change the destination or remove the entry\"; the status workflow renders it with \"/doctor:overlay apply --relayout\" beside it.\n\n## Traceability Pass\n\n- LAYOUT line format and both remedies: engine \\`$E:3693-3696\\` = \\`$P:87-88\\` = \\`$O:92\\`.\n- Overflow forms: engine \\`$E:3698-3708\\` = \\`$P:118\\` = \\`$O:92\\`, word for word.\n- Relayout failure contract: engine \\`$E:6531-6549\\` = \\`$O:96\\` = apply YAML line 116, apart from the backup overclaim (R1-P2-001).\n- No doctor doc cites an engine line number, so no pointer can go stale; specs do (phase 002), and those were re-derived (iteration 4).\n- Route flags: \\`$CT:114\\` asserts apply's four flags; pass.\n\n## Maintainability Pass\n\n- The remedy wording lives in the engine and is restated in full in four doc places (presentation lines 87-96 and 118, overlays.md line 92, apply YAML line 116), plus the two generic pointers in the presentation and the status YAML. The two copies that missed the root/skilled exception (R2-P2-001 and finding 1) are both the short generic ones, so the drift sits where a doc summarizes instead of quoting. Recorded as the shared root cause of those findings, not as a separate finding.\n\n## Traceability Checks\n\n- spec_code: partial. Quoted text matches the engine; the generic LAYOUT guidance in two places does not.\n- playbook_capability: pass for the contract test (9 of 9).\n\n## Edge Cases\n\n- None beyond the shared-root-cause note.\n\n## Confirmed-Clean Surfaces\n\n- LAYOUT quoting in presentation, overlays.md and apply YAML; contract test.\n\n## Ruled Out\n\n- Stale engine line pointers in doctor docs: there are none.\n\n## Next Focus\n\n- Dimension: traceability\n- Focus area: frontier node F-1-005 (Barter), with maintainability in the same pass\n- Reason: registry rotation\n- Rotation status: F-1-001 and F-1-003 all dimensions done\n- Required evidence: ai-speckit 039 record against 5dd004f3faa; hook duplication\n\nReview verdict: CONDITIONAL\nEOF\ncat > $L/prompts/spec-010.json <<EOF\n{\"iteration\":10,\"node\":\"F-1-003\",\"dimension\":\"traceability\",\"dimensionsOverride\":[\"traceability\",\"maintainability\"],\"scope\":[\"$SY\",\"$P\",\"$O\"],\"priorWeighted\":16,\n\"filesReviewed\":[\"$SY:58\",\"$P:118\",\"$O:92\",\"$E:3693\",\"$CT:114\"],\n\"findings\":[{\"id\":\"R10-P2-001\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"title\":\"The status workflow tells the agent to name apply --relayout beside every LAYOUT line, including those relayout refuses\",\"file\":\"$SY:58\",\"findingClass\":\"workflow-doc-contradiction\",\"refines\":\"R2-P2-001\"}],\n\"traceability\":[{\"protocolId\":\"spec_code\",\"status\":\"partial\",\"gateClass\":\"hard\",\"applicable\":true,\"evidence\":[\"$SY:58\",\"$E:3693\"],\"summary\":\"quoted LAYOUT text matches; generic guidance in two places lacks the exception\"},{\"protocolId\":\"playbook_capability\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"gateClass\":\"overlay\",\"applicable\":true,\"evidence\":[\"$CT:114\"],\"summary\":\"contract test 9 of 9\"}],\n\"novelty\":\"One P2 refining R2-P2-001 in the executable status workflow; docs otherwise quote the engine exactly.\",\n\"ledger\":[{\"bugClass\":\"doc_code_drift\",\"targetRefs\":[\"$SY\"],\"hypothesis\":\"a workflow still gives the single relayout remedy\",\"result\":\"status YAML names relayout beside every LAYOUT line\",\"evidenceRefs\":[\"$SY:58\"],\"disposition\":\"finding\",\"linkedFindingId\":\"R10-P2-001\"},\n{\"bugClass\":\"stale_pointer\",\"targetRefs\":[\"$O\",\"$P\"],\"hypothesis\":\"docs cite engine line numbers that moved\",\"result\":\"no engine line pointers in doctor docs\",\"evidenceRefs\":[\"$O:92\"],\"disposition\":\"ruled_out\"}],\n\"ruledOut\":[{\"direction\":\"stale engine line pointers in doctor docs\",\"reason\":\"none exist\"}]}\nEOF\nnode $L/prompts/emit.cjs $L/prompts/spec-010.json $L 2026-11-20T17:14:00Z 2>&1 | cut -c1-60; node $L/prompts/graph.cjs $L 10 | cut -c1-60; node $L/prompts/conv.cjs $L 10 3 3","description":"Write, record, graph and converge iteration 10"}}}
